      "fromCache": false
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "E-opa",
      "narration": "第一类，组织过程资产 OPA。这是组织自身沉淀下来的家底和武功秘籍。比如开发工具、标准模板、历史数据库、经验教训库、公司的请假与采购政策流程。这些资产是组织内部可复用、可补充、可修改的。",
      "narrationSha256": "13e0a1c8ebc791709dae609149ce325587a7f588ac88815bad15b2ad039fe004",
      "wavPath": "/projects/gaoxiang/course-video-pipeline-codex/workspaces/ch06-L01-environment/audio/E-opa.wav",
      "wavSha256": "127bd9618ef49172c8ad341124bb256e9d1cebe27c958cae9f8c0a2c9e3ad104",
      "startMs": 28097,
      "endMs": 49104,
      "durationMs": 21007,
      "fromCache": false
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "E-eef",
      "narration": "第二类，事业环境因素 EEF。这是项目团队必须面对的客观水土和外部天候，团队无法随意改变，只能去主动适应。它又分为内部和外部：",
      "narrationSha256": "c4a8de825d47f77a7f9bd52bf2d8d00f70de0d61f488ac11a9be54241ea57129",
      "wavPath": "/projects/gaoxiang/course-video-pipeline-codex/workspaces/ch06-L01-environment/audio/E-eef.wav",
      "wavSha256": "1aa33ba12af458dd5e4f9957241103f086d6f6d3417adcc9a1f7d9b42f6b2bcd",
      "startMs": 49104,
      "endMs": 63850,
      "durationMs": 14746,
      "fromCache": false
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "E-internal",
      "narration": "在公司大门内，有组织的文化结构、办公基础设施，以及两个极易做错的内部因素——第一，设施和资源的物理分布，比如团队分布在不同时区、虚拟办公，这是客观物理限制，属于内部事业环境因素；第二，员工现有的技能水平和能力，这是存量客观状态，也属于内部事业环境因素！",
      "narrationSha256": "7d7995e3cb421621e8dc60cc9c6320161ea09a2287b6307ef9c65870bbc3e7a4",
      "wavPath": "/projects/gaoxiang/course-video-pipeline-codex/workspaces/ch06-L01-environment/audio/E-internal.wav",
